WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.247
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Debate!

2
00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:06.991
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:07.291 --> 00:00:09.789
Today's topic is Writing Stories.

4
00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:16.605
Today we practise giving our ideas. There is no wrong answer, but we must say why.

5
00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:18.595
Character!

6
00:00:19.495 --> 00:00:21.787
Character. Your turn!

7
00:00:24.687 --> 00:00:25.758
Character!

8
00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:26.838
Great!

9
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.014
Setting!

10
00:00:29.914 --> 00:00:31.904
Setting. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.804 --> 00:00:35.863
Setting!

12
00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:37.257
Wonderful!

13
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.216
Beginning!

14
00:00:40.116 --> 00:00:42.444
Beginning. Your turn!

15
00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:46.170
Beginning!

16
00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.425
Super!

17
00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:49.162
Middle!

18
00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:51.972
Middle. Your turn!

19
00:00:54.872 --> 00:00:55.641
Middle!

20
00:00:55.941 --> 00:00:56.965
Excellent!

21
00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.716
Which do you like better, Character or Setting?

22
00:01:04.516 --> 00:01:07.293
I like Character because it is fun.

23
00:01:07.593 --> 00:01:08.618
Good reason!

24
00:01:09.617 --> 00:01:12.745
Use because to give a reason. For example:

25
00:01:13.045 --> 00:01:15.579
I like Setting because it is nice.

26
00:01:16.379 --> 00:01:17.554
Your turn!

27
00:01:21.854 --> 00:01:24.120
I like Setting because it is nice.

28
00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:28.431
I think Character is fun. Do you agree?

29
00:01:32.231 --> 00:01:33.731
Yes, I agree!

30
00:01:34.031 --> 00:01:37.961
Be kind when you disagree. Say: I think differently.

31
00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.603
Listen to your friends. Take turns. Be polite.

32
00:01:42.903 --> 00:01:44.682
I will try, Ms. Lily!

33
00:01:45.683 --> 00:01:50.637
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

34
00:01:50.937 --> 00:01:51.892
Bye-bye!

